      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "scenedesc"
      ],
      "text": "Enter a Gentleman.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 17,
          "className": "charname"
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@154674/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 18,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 279789,
        "end": 279866,
        "line": 9080,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap02/p@154674",
        "anchor": "sceneV_2.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": null,
      "attribution": {
        "status": "not-applicable"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@154755",
      "type": "passage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "This man may help me to his majesty’s ear,\nIf he would spend his power. God save you, sir.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@154755/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 42,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@154755/line-2",
          "start": 43,
          "end": 90,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 279870,
        "end": 279990,
        "line": 9084,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap02/p@154755",
        "anchor": "sceneV_2.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": null,
      "attribution": {
        "status": "source-unlabelled"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@154879",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "GENTLEMAN.\nAnd you.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@154879/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 10,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@154879/line-2",
          "start": 11,
          "end": 19,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 279994,
        "end": 280043,
        "line": 9089,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap02/p@154879",
        "anchor": "sceneV_2.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "GENTLEMAN.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@154932",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "HELENA.\nSir, I have seen you in the court of France.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@154932/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@154932/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 52,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 280047,
        "end": 280129,
        "line": 9094,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap02/p@154932",
        "anchor": "sceneV_2.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "HELENA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@155018",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "GENTLEMAN.\nI have been sometimes there.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@155018/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 10,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@155018/line-2",
          "start": 11,
          "end": 39,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 280133,
        "end": 280202,
        "line": 9099,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap02/p@155018",
        "anchor": "sceneV_2.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "GENTLEMAN.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@155091",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "HELENA.\nI do presume, sir, that you are not fallen\nFrom the report that goes upon your goodness;\nAnd therefore, goaded with most sharp occasions,\nWhich lay nice manners by, I put you to\nThe use of your own virtues, for the which\nI shall continue thankful.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@155091/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@155091/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 50,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@155091/line-3",
          "start": 51,
          "end": 96,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@155091/line-4",
          "start": 97,
          "end": 145,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@155091/line-5",
          "start": 146,
          "end": 185,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@155091/line-6",
          "start": 186,
          "end": 228,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@155091/line-7",
          "start": 229,
          "end": 255,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 280206,
        "end": 280516,
        "line": 9104,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap02/p@155091",
        "anchor": "sceneV_2.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "HELENA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@155405",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "GENTLEMAN.\nWhat’s your will?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@155405/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 10,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@155405/line-2",
          "start": 11,
          "end": 28,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 280520,
        "end": 280578,
        "line": 9114,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap02/p@155405",
        "anchor": "sceneV_2.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "GENTLEMAN.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@155467",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "HELENA.\nThat it will please you\nTo give this poor petition to the king,\nAnd aid me with that store of power you have\nTo come into his presence.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@155467/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@155467/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 31,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@155467/line-3",
          "start": 32,
          "end": 71,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@155467/line-4",
          "start": 72,
          "end": 116,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@155467/line-5",
          "start": 117,
          "end": 143,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 280582,
        "end": 280770,
        "line": 9119,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap02/p@155467",
        "anchor": "sceneV_2.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "HELENA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@155659",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "GENTLEMAN.\nThe king’s not here.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@155659/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 10,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@155659/line-2",
          "start": 11,
          "end": 31,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 280774,
        "end": 280835,
        "line": 9127,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap02/p@155659",
        "anchor": "sceneV_2.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "GENTLEMAN.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@155724",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "HELENA.\nNot here, sir?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@155724/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@155724/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 22,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 280839,
        "end": 280891,
        "line": 9132,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap02/p@155724",
        "anchor": "sceneV_2.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "HELENA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@155780",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "GENTLEMAN.\nNot indeed.\nHe hence remov’d last night, and with more haste\nThan is his use.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@155780/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 10,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@155780/line-2",
          "start": 11,
          "end": 22,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@155780/line-3",
          "start": 23,
          "end": 71,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@155780/line-4",
          "start": 72,
          "end": 88,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 280895,
        "end": 281023,
        "line": 9137,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap02/p@155780",
        "anchor": "sceneV_2.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "GENTLEMAN.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@155912",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "WIDOW.\nLord, how we lose our pains!",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@155912/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@155912/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 35,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 281027,
        "end": 281092,
        "line": 9144,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap02/p@155912",
        "anchor": "sceneV_2.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "WIDOW.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@155981",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "HELENA.\nAll’s well that ends well yet,\nThough time seem so adverse and means unfit.\nI do beseech you, whither is he gone?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@155981/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@155981/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 38,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@155981/line-3",
          "start": 39,
          "end": 83,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@155981/line-4",
          "start": 84,
          "end": 121,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 281096,
        "end": 281257,
        "line": 9149,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap02/p@155981",
        "anchor": "sceneV_2.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "HELENA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@156146",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "GENTLEMAN.\nMarry, as I take it, to Rossillon;\nWhither I am going.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@156146/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 10,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneV_2.1/p@156146/line-2",
          "start": 11,
          "end": 45,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
